type: software
title: "YIN OpenScholar Research Engine"
authors:
  - family-names: Alqayadhi
    given-names: "Abdulbari Ahmed"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-1670-4911"
version: 0.4.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alqayadhia123/YIN-OpenScholar-Research-Engine"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual research-literature discovery and workflow-tracking tool using
  OpenAlex and Crossref, with DOI metadata checks, reference export, and
  optional language-model-assisted claim review. Outputs require human
  verification and do not constitute a complete systematic review.
keywords:
  - research discovery
  - literature review
  - OpenAlex
  - Crossref
  - DOI
  - research software
  - Arabic
  - English
